{
  "name": "Transcripción de Videos de Instagram via Telegram (@CronistaYT_bot)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎬 Transcripción de Instagram via Telegram\n\n### Antes de activar, configura:\n\n**1. Credencial de Telegram:**\n- Ve a Credentials → New → Telegram\n- Pega el token de @CronistaYT_bot (obtenido de @BotFather)\n- Nombra la credencial: `CronistaYT Bot`\n\n**2. Variables en n8n (Settings → Variables):**\n- `RAPIDAPI_KEY` → tu clave de RapidAPI\n  - Suscríbete a instagram-scraper-api2 en rapidapi.com\n- `OPENAI_API_KEY` → tu clave de OpenAI\n\n**3. Activar webhook de Telegram:**\n- Activa el workflow y copia la URL del webhook del nodo Trigger\n- Regístrala llamando:\n  `https://api.telegram.org/bot{TOKEN}/setWebhook?url={WEBHOOK_URL}`\n\n### Uso:\n1. Envía o reenvía un link de Instagram al bot @CronistaYT_bot\n2. El bot descarga el video y transcribe el audio con Whisper\n3. Recibes la transcripción en el mismo chat\n\n### Tipos de links soportados:\n- Reels: instagram.com/reel/...\n- Posts con video: instagram.com/p/...\n- IGTV: instagram.com/tv/...",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "📋 Instrucciones de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, -200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [200, 360],
      "webhookId": "cronista-instagram-transcripcion",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "CronistaYT Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const message = $input.first().json?.message || {};\nconst text = message?.text || message?.caption || '';\nconst chat_id = message?.chat?.id;\nconst message_id = message?.message_id;\nconst from_name = message?.from?.first_name || 'Usuario';\n\n// Match Instagram URLs: reels, posts, TV, stories\nconst instagramRegex = /https?:\\/\\/(www\\.)?(instagram\\.com|instagr\\.am)\\/[^\\s]+/gi;\nconst matches = text.match(instagramRegex);\nconst raw_url = matches ? matches[0] : null;\n\n// Remove trailing punctuation that may be part of the message, not the URL\nconst url = raw_url ? raw_url.replace(/[.,;!?:)\"']+$/, '') : null;\n\nreturn [{ \n  json: { \n    url,\n    chat_id,\n    message_id,\n    from_name\n  } \n}];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Extraer URL de Instagram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [420, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-has-url",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "¿Contiene URL de Instagram?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [640, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "⏳ Descargando y transcribiendo el video de Instagram... Dame unos segundos.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Enviar: Procesando",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [880, 220],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "CronistaYT Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ No encontré un link de Instagram en tu mensaje.\n\nComparte un link así:\n`https://www.instagram.com/reel/ABC123/`",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Error: No es Instagram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [880, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "CronistaYT Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://instagram-scraper-api2.p.rapidapi.com/v1/post_info",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "code_or_id_or_url",
              "value": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.url }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Key",
              "value": "={{ $vars.RAPIDAPI_KEY }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "instagram-scraper-api2.p.rapidapi.com"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "Obtener Info de Instagram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1100, 220],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "❌ No pude acceder al video. El post puede ser privado, una historia o el link es inválido.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "reply_to_message_id": "={{ $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Error: Post inaccesible",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1320, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "CronistaYT Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\n\n// Handle multiple response structures from Instagram Scraper API\nlet videoUrl = null;\nconst items = data?.data?.items || data?.items || [];\nconst item = items[0] || data?.data || data;\n\n// Try each possible location for the video URL\nif (item?.video_url) {\n  videoUrl = item.video_url;\n} else if (item?.video_versions?.length > 0) {\n  videoUrl = item.video_versions[0]?.url;\n} else if (item?.carousel_media) {\n  for (const media of item.carousel_media) {\n    if (media.video_url) { videoUrl = media.video_url; break; }\n    if (media.video_versions?.[0]?.url) { videoUrl = media.video_versions[0].url; break; }\n  }\n}\n\nconst chat_id = $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.chat_id;\nconst message_id = $('Extraer URL de Instagram').item.json.message_id;\n\nif (!videoUrl) {\n  throw new Error('No se encontró video. ¿Es una imagen o post privado?');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { videoUrl, chat_id, message_id } }];"
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Extraer URL del Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1320, 220],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
